<h3><u>Mera asghar</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haye asghar, haye asghar..(4)<br />
maa ye maqtal mein roke kehti thi<br />
noke naiza pe hai mera asghar</p>

<p>qabr se aagaya hai naize par<br />
qadd tera itna badh gaya asghar</p>

<p>1. Aye mere cheh mahine wale ali<br />
laaj rakhli hai tune madar ki..(2)<br />
ab na roungi tujhko paala hai<br />
tu jo maqtal mein has diya asghar<br />
maa ye maqtal....</p>

<p>2. Apni ankho&#39;n se mai lagati unhe<br />
tere qadmo ke jo nishaa&#39;n hote..(2)<br />
maa ko armaan reh gaya dil mein<br />
ghutniyo bhi nahi chala asghar<br />
maa ye maqtal....</p>

<p>3. Tu to bus cheh mahine wala tha<br />
uska akbar jawaan beta tha..(2)<br />
samne maine umme laila ke<br />
tera pursa nahi liya asghar<br />
maa ye maqtal....</p>

<p>4. Bibiyo&#39;n dekho mere bachhe ko<br />
karliya band isne aankho&#39;n ko..(2)<br />
maa ko na mehramo ke majme mein<br />
kaise dekhega berida asghar<br />
maa ye maqtal....</p>

<p>5. Jaan ye soch kar nikalti hai<br />
tune aye laal cheh mahino mein..(2)<br />
itna paani nahi piya hoga<br />
tune jitna ugal diya asghar<br />
maa ye maqtal....</p>

<p>6. Jaake jannat mein aye mere beta<br />
tum to mohsin ke saath kheloge..(2)<br />
maa sakina ko kya dilasa de<br />
kisse khelegi wo bhala asghar<br />
maa ye maqtal....</p>

<p>7. Leke nanhe se sar ko godi mein<br />
maa takallum ye roke kehti thi..(2)<br />
ab to ankho&#39;n ko khol de beta<br />
mil gayi hai mujhe rida asghar<br />
maa ye maqtal....</p>
</p>
